WEBVTT

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:06.240
It's been one week since the collapse of the new Tokyo multipurpose radio tower.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:12.020
According to officials, fuel used for construction left at the site caught fire when struck by lightning...

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.020
No!

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:14.280
No, no, no!

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:15.470
Rose, listen to me!

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.730
No!

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.370
My friends are... Rose, calm down!

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:21.040
No, no, no, no!

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:22.010
"When: August 8-9"

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:22.010
"Where: Maizuna Grand Hotel"

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:20.740
Calm down!

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:23.800
Oh, my.

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:28.020
It hurts, Rose!

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:03.800
No!

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:03.920
Rose, calm down.

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:08.500
"Beauty on the Beach"

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:07.360
Well, you're going to be away from each other for three days.

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.580
Don't act like this doesn't concern you!

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.460
Say what you want.

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:14.880
Sorry, I promised I'd go before you showed up.

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:18.580
No!

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:26.810
Hey, Rose!

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:28.100
Calm down!

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:38.620
I suppose there's no alternative.

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:41.220
I'll help you.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:42.900
Really?

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:47.030
Of course, I expect you to return the favor.

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:49.090
Over here.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:05.500
Eriko-san, what are you telling her?

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:09.910
It's a secret.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:29.590
This place is amazing.

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:32.200
It's my dad's company's private beach.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:39.700
Beautiful white sand, clear waters of the tropics, and a select food spot.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:46.130
We have everything we need for love. Now we just have to make it happen!

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:47.950
Ryuji, I'll do it!

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:48.740
Thanks for waiting.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:52.100
This year I'll have the summer of love I've been dreaming of!

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:03.130
Eto-san, don't you think that's a little much for the beach?

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:20.720
This is...

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.740
Keeping it hidden is even more erotic!

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.910
Let's get going.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:29.630
Hey, wait.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:31.690
What are you doing?

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:33.820
This is your chance to get closer to Ryuji-kun!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.760
It's okay.

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:48.990
There's nothing wrong with me.

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.130
It's okay.

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.550
Ryuji-kun.

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:15.590
Ryuji-kun.

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:29.310
Ryuji!

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:31.940
Rose!

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:36.900
Ryuji, the ocean is amazing! Look at all the water!

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.260
What are you doing here?

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:40.520
My, my.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.150
What a coincidence.

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:47.800
What's going on, Eriko-san?

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:51.840
It's summer. We want to have fun, too.

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:54.420
They'll notice Rose's mark of the dragon.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.100
It's fine.

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:59.700
This is artificial skin, Tokura-san's special appliance.

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:02.210
They'll never be able to tell just by looking.

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.620
Ryuji-kun, what are you ignoring Misaki for?

00:06:05.620 --> 00:06:11.280
Ryuji! That sexy lady isn't enough for you? Who's this beautiful girl?

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:14.050
Don't be a stranger. Introduce me!

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:33.600
I'm hungry.

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:45.190
Kisaragi-sama, we have a message for you.

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:53.190
Dragon?

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:03.360
It's chilly, isn't it?

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.750
You don't need to come with me.

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:08.210
I'm the only one who's been called.

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:11.160
Did you think that would stop us from going with you?

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:12.610
Did you think it would?

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:16.190
I have been waiting for you.

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:26.140
You sent me the letter?

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:27.530
Yes.

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:30.700
Allow me to introduce myself properly.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:36.890
I am the empress of white dragons, rulers of ice and snow, Margarite.

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:39.830
Please call me Maruga.

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:43.690
Kisaragi Ryuji-san, Nanao Eriko-san...

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:52.280
And you must be the red dragon princess.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.720
I'm Rose.

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:57.150
I have heard rumors about you.

00:07:57.150 --> 00:08:01.090
I am counting on your strength to help me with a problem.

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:07.870
I want you to recover the white dragon sword stolen by humans.

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:14.690
The sword is currently known as the Lost Precious "Ice Rage".

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:21.740
The owner is George Evans, a level 10 breaker staying in a nearby church.

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:26.140
Bloody George the black punisher...

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:38.940
He's a powerful fighter of the Anglican Church that proclaims dragons are servants of the devil.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:46.740
Yes. If the sword remains in their possession, I am certain disaster will come of it.

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:50.390
Aren't there plenty of others you could ask for help?

00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:54.470
I have heard you are the world's eighth level 10 breaker.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:59.430
They say you are a valuable person who shows understanding for dragons.

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:04.990
You are only human, but you engaged with that princess.

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:09.270
That's not... I only just learned how to use my powers.

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:12.760
What do we have to gain by taking back the sword?

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:15.460
I am prepared to reward you.

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:18.200
However, you will be unable to refuse my request.

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:26.760
George came to Japan to bring justice to the dragon that has appeared here and those harboring her.

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:35.220
If you refuse to help me, I will tell him everything I know about you.

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.420
That sounded like a threat.

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:40.700
Call it what you will.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:47.320
I am staying at the same hotel as you. Let me know if anything happens.

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:53.980
Whatever she looks like, she's still a dragon.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:56.070
She's quite the princess.

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:07.760
Rose, Onyx, Maruga...

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:10.760
These dragons...

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:26.010
I feel like it's become more dangerous around here since that giant showed up at the church.

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:33.240
I can't stand any more of this!

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:37.500
First a black dragon, and now we have to deal with a level 10 breaker!

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:40.490
At least we're prepared.

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:45.120
Eriko-san, did you know George had come to Japan?

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:49.920
I'd heard rumors. I didn't think he'd actually come here.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:53.680
If they're coming here even if we keep our mouths shut, we should go after them.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:55.220
They'd get us first!

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:57.950
Are we supposed to wait for them to attack us?

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:01.940
I'll go to the church tomorrow to check things out.

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:03.320
I'll go, too!

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:30.400
Do you have business with the church?

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:39.810
Um...

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.970
I wanted to take a look inside, so I...

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:47.810
I see! Welcome.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:51.370
There's been a lot of suspicious characters lately. Please take your time.

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:56.200
I am George, a guest of this church.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:12:00.700
The priest is out, so I cannot offer you a detailed explanation.

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:05.990
As you can see, the construction is just like those in England.

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:09.200
You'll notice God's majesty permeates every corner of...

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.410
George-san.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:11.510
What is it?

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.480
Is this a sword?

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:24.840
Are you also a breaker?

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:27.680
What? Yes, I suppose...

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.680
So am I!

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.830
Are you a member of the society?

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:33.570
No...

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:36.290
I can't quite use my powers.

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:38.960
I see. Well, there's no reason to worry.

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:45.380
When I was your age, I blamed myself for being unable to live up to the expectations of those around me.

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:48.760
How did you solve your problem?

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:50.290
I accepted it.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:55.050
My immature self and the path I was meant to take.

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:57.410
Do you believe in dragons?

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:04.140
This sword is Ice Rage, the icy wrath of God.

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:05.780
It's a Lost Precious.

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:11.900
One hundred years ago, a village was attacked by a dragon and was on the brink of destruction.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:16.500
They say a lone hero appeared.

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:22.160
He risked his life fighting and left after defeating the dragon.

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:28.210
He left behind this sword which was venerated by the villagers as a legendary sword.

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:34.180
When I received this sword from the church, I knew what I was meant to do.

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:38.280
Kill dragons, the servants of the devil.

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:43.150
If you throw away your uncertainty and pursue only what you are meant to do...

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:45.920
you will naturally gain control of your powers.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:50.330
You may find yourself unable to believe in dragons, though.

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:52.740
Oh?

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.940
What a cute little guest.

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:58.040
Ryuji, there you are!

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.450
Rose!

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:04.450
I told you not to come here!

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:05.910
I do not mind.

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:08.720
The church should be open to all.

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:15.060
Rose-chan, was it?

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:17.280
You must be warm. Would you like some ice cream?

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:18.170
Yes!

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:20.550
Okay. I'll bring you some.

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:21.750
Um...

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:26.390
George-san, have you met a dragon?

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:33.240
Dragons are beasts of legend.

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:35.820
Unfortunately, I haven't met one yet.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:40.060
Let's leave now.

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.970
But he said he'd give me ice cream.

00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:44.530
If he finds out who you are, he'll kill you!

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:45.610
Why?

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:48.770
There she is!

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:54.500
What am I going to do about this hair?

00:14:56.080 --> 00:15:00.390
They grabbed my arm, so I burned them.

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:03.320
What are you going on about?

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:06.260
Hand her over!

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:07.800
What are you doing?

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:11.380
These are sacred grounds for listening to God's words.

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:13.470
Stay out of this, old man!

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:15.330
Go back to your country!

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:21.520
Those harsh words you cast upon this young girl and your blasphemous attitudes.

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:26.160
Unforgivable! I shall punish you infidels in God's name!

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:28.310
Calm down.

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:29.760
You should get out of here.

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:32.150
Infidels? We're atheists.

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:34.160
Old man, what is that?

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:38.060
Who are you calling "old man?"

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:39.970
I'm nineteen!

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:42.320
What? You're underage?

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:53.860
Who is this guy?

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:59.350
The next time we meet will be the day you die, scum.

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:01.820
Are you all right?

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:06.010
Oh, no!

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:09.200
What are you doing? Let's go.

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:22.730
George-san said Ice Rage was the sword a hero used to defeat a dragon.

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:26.990
Don't you think it's odd to value a sword used to kill your own kind?

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:29.760
Is it really the white dragon sword?

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:34.970
I am sorry I cannot be more specific.

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:39.690
However, I am certain that sword belongs to the white dragons.

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:43.630
Please take back the sword for us.

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:51.910
There you are!

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:54.260
Ryuji-kun, don't you think you're spending too much time with these people...

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:57.070
when you came here with us?

00:16:57.070 --> 00:17:00.700
Mao-chan, they look like they're in the middle of something.

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:03.600
Let me introduce you.

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:06.880
This is Maruga. I met her studying abroad.

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:09.240
Nice to meet...

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:12.010
Nice to meet you! I'm Aikawa Masato!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:14.770
I'm a healthy young Japanese high school boy.

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:17.520
Would you like to go to the festival together?

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:23.970
Let's go. I'm sure it'll be fun.

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:26.080
We'll show you around a Japanese festival.

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.780
Ryuji, it's a dragon ranger!

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:39.230
When have you been watching that?

00:17:39.230 --> 00:17:41.180
Rose is full of energy.

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:42.150
Yes.

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:45.460
Are you okay?

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:47.590
Why do I have to wear this?

00:17:47.590 --> 00:17:49.500
Don't you have festivals like this in your country?

00:17:49.180 --> 00:17:51.060
Who is this man?

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:52.580
Carnivals and tomato festivals?

00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:52.850
He's not a bad guy.

00:17:52.850 --> 00:17:54.170
He's just a handful.

00:17:57.810 --> 00:17:59.850
Don't touch me!

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:07.700
What were you thinking, suddenly inviting me to a place like this?

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:12.160
I thought it'd cheer you up.

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:15.850
I do not need your concern.

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:17.170
Sorry!

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:19.500
They're eating clouds! Ryuji, let's go!

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:20.820
Hey, Rose!

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:24.240
Maruga-chan, do you want some shaved ice?

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:26.030
A traditional Japanese summer food...

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:29.720
a sub-zero fantasy of ice and colored sugar...

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:31.760
Japanese crushed ice!

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:36.370
It's sweet and delicious!

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:38.360
Oh, you...

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:40.270
Here.

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:42.210
Thanks.

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:44.550
You two are like a married couple.

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:49.110
Huh? Where's Rose?

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.020
Rose.

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:54.750
I want that.

00:18:53.390 --> 00:18:54.880
"Bullseye!"

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:02.890
Ryuji, you're so cool!

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:04.560
Ryuji-kun, you can do it.

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:06.720
Focus, focus.

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:08.640
Focus...

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.810
Focus...

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:19.140
Congratulations.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:21.430
Here.

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.910
Eto-san, is there anything you want?

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:26.280
I don't...

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:28.400
How about that stuffed animal?

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:33.280
What kind of moron buys shaved ice with a card?

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:35.610
Do you think we're stupid, kid?

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:37.510
I'll get some cash right away.

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:38.720
What?

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:41.870
Our motto's clean cash every time!

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:45.250
Why don't we talk at our office, miss?

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:49.210
Where ever we are, I will neither run nor hide.

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:56.310
I thought I heard you scum disrupting the festivities again.

00:19:56.870 --> 00:20:00.070
I told you the next time we met would be the day you'd die.

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:01.770
George-san!

00:20:01.770 --> 00:20:03.260
Let me handle this.

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:10.150
Leave this to me!

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:13.100
Any way you look at it, they're in the wrong this time!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.440
Quiet, you filthy scum!

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:17.250
Get out of here!

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:20.670
Divine retribution!

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:22.850
Ryuji-kun!

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:25.390
Let's go, Maruga!

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:32.280
What's going on over there?

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:33.380
Who knows?

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:38.050
I wonder if everyone got away safely.

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:40.370
I would have been fine by myself.

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:41.480
Sorry.

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:43.990
You certainly are meddlesome.

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:46.390
Ryuji's not meddlesome.

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:49.200
Rose, I can't breathe.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:53.810
Let me tell you a story.

00:20:55.190 --> 00:21:00.540
Once upon a time, a dragon fell in love with a human girl.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:08.130
However, the villagers killed her for her contact with a despicable creature.

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:15.130
When the dragon found out, he was consumed by rage and attacked the village, killing many humans.

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:21.140
The dragon died at the hands of a villager.

00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:24.770
The incident caused a deep rift between the two communities...

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:29.140
and not a single dragon and human couple has formed since.

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:33.150
That sounds like George-san's story...

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:34.900
There you are.

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:39.590
I came because I'd heard there would be a dragon themed dance.

00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:42.530
Excuse me...

00:21:43.310 --> 00:21:47.050
I am George Evans. I'm staying in the nearby church.

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:50.400
Would you like to join me for mass some time?

00:23:25.010 --> 00:23:39.910
Next episode "Unpleasant Awakening"

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:30.130
This is Eto Misaki here to teach you about the applications of "hau."

